note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note apps/omega-mesh/mesh_route.om
note Sovereign Intelligence 2.0 Stage 5 (Pillar 5: Zero-Trust Personal Silicon Mesh, DRA-1073)
note
note Pure seeded OM-2 Compile-on-Arrive Mesh Router, heterogeneous TargetDesc + WattCBF
note offload profitability solver, OMSH v1 signed wire framing, loopback-only TCP socket
note transport, and deterministic pure Compute-on-Arrive worker/client engine.
note
note HARD SAFETY INVARIANTS:
note   - Zero GPU device opens, zero UEFI/SPI touches, zero sysfs writes (hw_writes == 0).
note   - Wildcard 0.0.0.0 bind/endpoint is STRICTLY REFUSED fail-closed (loopback 127.0.0.1
note     or explicit non-zero WireGuard/LAN unicast endpoints only).
note   - Remote outputs enter OMEGA-MEMO ONLY through mesh_verify.om's fail-closed gate.
note
note Library unit (no om2 header, no fn main; prefix mr_ / MR_).
note Link directly after apps/omega-mesh/mesh_verify.om.

note Heterogeneous personal-mesh TargetDesc IDs (extending target_desc.om slots 10..12)
const MR_TID_MACBOOK ulong 10
const MR_TID_STEAMDECK ulong 11
const MR_TID_PC ulong 12

note Node roles
const MR_ROLE_MACBOOK ulong 1
const MR_ROLE_STEAMDECK ulong 2
const MR_ROLE_PC ulong 3
const MR_ROLE_SPARK_CPU ulong 4
const MR_ROLE_SPARK_GPU ulong 5

